<title>UK: STOCKHOLM SETS 100 MILLION SWISS FRANC BOND.</title>
<headline>STOCKHOLM SETS 100 MILLION SWISS FRANC BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>lead manager UBS Zurich.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITY OF STOCKHOLM</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN SFR   COUPON     2.75	MATURITY    30.SEP.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.70    PAY DATE    30.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  STD	 LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   05.SEP.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA+   DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		THERE IS A REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
